{"id":919,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>2017年12月13日上午，曾建潮副校长、教务处吴淑琴处长、董小瑞副处长和国际教育学院张宗胜院长一行来我院调研专业调整和教学工作，我院院领导和学科部主任、副主任参加了调研。曾校长对专业调整的背景、要求和原则进行了重点说明，王志军院长介绍了我院本科专业的特点和运行情况，校院两级就专业调整和专业建设的思路及构想展开了深入研讨。最后，王院长表态认真领会学校专业调整的精神，经学院讨论后提出可行的调整方案。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=JUl-04L7-8L49YMaRvaMR7bLm9sLlCPPM8U4olLiozlaMz70gihFp2hmCIa0MYyaMkh2nSyioz-PMm78n7C4UmfkMNLsMRWkn7LbM77aMNnFLNMRLmG4olrFLzVVL8-Jqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMzl0MRLioSbw62Y8c&oid=1201705132&tid=1055&nid=4359&e=.jpg\" vwidth=\" 423px\" vheight=\"308\" vurl=\"/_vsl/704FE5921614DF3B0B6C742BDC94A06D/2CC2039E/11E3B\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=JUl-04L7-8L49YMaRvaMR7bLm9sLlCPPM8U4olLiozlaMz70gihFp2hmCIa0MYyaMkh2nSyioz-PMm78n7C4UmfkMNLsMRWkn7LbM77aMNnFLNMRLmG4olrFLzVVL8-Jqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMzl0MRLioSbw62Y8c&oid=1201705132&tid=1055&nid=4359&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=JLmW07ozviUzn7namf2Mz74M46Vo77PZnNlPMmCsMl-8MmL0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hRnkyZL1ybMRVfL4UYU49ZLRlPL8Q2nNUZMzviL4-bnlQFMzLiMmfRnRAFLz7bUzLJqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMzl0MRLioSbw62Y8c&oid=1201705132&tid=1055&nid=4359&e=.jpg\" vwidth=\" 422px\" vheight=\" 302px\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6CD82941A342C880513FFFD8575329EF/53560CD8/119A3\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=JLmW07ozviUzn7namf2Mz74M46Vo77PZnNlPMmCsMl-8MmL0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hRnkyZL1ybMRVfL4UYU49ZLRlPL8Q2nNUZMzviL4-bnlQFMzLiMmfRnRAFLz7bUzLJqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMzl0MRLioSbw62Y8c&oid=1201705132&tid=1055&nid=4359&e=.jpg\"></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jdgc.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=JUl-04L7-8L49YMaRvaMR7bLm9sLlCPPM8U4olLiozlaMz70gihFp2hmCIa0MYyaMkh2nSyioz-PMm78n7C4UmfkMNLsMRWkn7LbM77aMNnFLNMRLmG4olrFLzVVL8-Jqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMzl0MRLioSbw62Y8c&oid=1201705132&tid=1055&nid=4359&e=.jpg"}